Tesla needs a record September in China to salvage the quarter after August's 12.4% sales drop. This is Tesla Shorts Time, Episode 599. August retail sales in China fell 12.4% year over year. Tesla must now deliver its highest monthly volume of the year in September, just to match the prior quarter. New cash incentives have been introduced to clear inventory before the quarter closes. The repeated shortfalls have forced Tesla to rely on promote

